      "message": "[error] Line 710: 🔴 `requestMediaIfNeeded()` sets `didRequestMedia \u003d true` before confirming media was actually resolved, so a transient miss (URL not ready yet, preview fetch failure, or `loadMedia` early-return) permanently prevents retries for that message. This can leave playable media stuck without controls/poster until the view model is recreated. Set `didRequestMedia` only after `updateMedia(...)` succeeds, or reset it on failure/early-return and trigger retry when URL becomes available.",
